# Reminiscence — Missing Implementation Plan (LLM-Free Direction)

Status: living backlog. Do not mark an item complete merely because an
interface exists — completion = implementation + integration + tests +
documentation + verification.

Legend: ✅ implemented & tested · 🟡 partial/foundation · 🔴 missing

---

## Verified baseline (as of this audit)

- 96/96 tests pass (`python -m pytest reminiscence/tests`)
- pyproject.toml, .env.example, CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml, security.yml) ✅
- MemoryEvent temporal semantics (event_time/captured_at/time_source/
  time_confidence) + reproducibility versions ✅
- SHA-256 content identity + dedup/moved-file handling ✅
- SQLite migrations through v5; entity tables (persons/places/
  events_entities/entity_links), inference_records, media_assets ✅
- Hybrid retrieval α–ζ fusion with DB-configurable weights ✅
- Rule-based query classifier (FACT/SOURCE_LOOKUP/TEMPORAL_LOOKUP/
  CROSS_SOURCE/VISUAL/EXPLANATION) + month/year parsing ✅
- Evidence resolver + ExtractiveGroundedAnswerer (LLM-free default) ✅
- OnnxLocalLLM exists as OPTIONAL adapter only ✅
- Persistent JobQueue (retries/recovery/priority) ✅
- Incremental re-indexing (content hash + pipeline/embedding version skip) ✅
- MediaStore (content-addressed, atomic, safe temp) ✅
- Model Manager (manifest/checksum/states, no silent downloads) ✅
- OCR backend abstraction + Whisper-ONNX ASR adapter (honest availability) 🟡
- Snapdragon/QNN runtime detection abstractions ✅ (hardware validation 🔴 — blocked on target device)

